	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Serial chains: NSP_SERI -> #1 (V9) -> #2 (V7) -> #3 (V22) -> NSP_SER5   and   NSP_SERI -> #4 (V24) -> #5 (V39) -> #6 (V51) -> NSP_SER8.\nThe SER.IN lines of #2, #3, #5 and #6 come from the previous sheet, captioned \"NSP_SERI\"; drawn as the wire from the previous pot SER.OUT.\nPrinted anomalies kept: #1 output BWT_1P (= its input), #4 input BWH_4P (= its output), #5 output BWK_5P.\nSignal roles are inferred; the patent text does not describe FIG 5D."
